    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Jia Chen Dang Mo </h2></h2>When a Taoist travels down the mountain, is it true that his skills are not as good as those of ghosts or is he reproducing the Jia Zi's demonic behavior.<br><br><br>You can enter various areas of ghosts to search for their traces.<br>\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014They find it difficult to find!<br><br>In the area, you can use various props to interact and communicate with ghosts, in order to explore the types of ghosts<br><br><br>Finally, understand the location of ghosts and use props to clear them. So as to complete the task.<br><br>Here you can learn some Chinese ways to dispel ghosts<br><br>You can also work on tasks with your teammates<br><br><u><strong><br>Finally, be careful that ghosts will attack you!!! Players who are afraid of fear infiltrating</strong></u>",
